                                :hasEvidence :WestpacResponsibleAIPrinciplesEvidence ;
                                :policyURL "https://www.westpac.com.au/about-westpac/westpac-group/corporate-governance/artificial-intelligence-at-westpac/"^^xsd:anyURI ;
                                rdfs:comment "Eight named principles published under Westpac's corporate governance section. The principle names and wording track Australia's AI Ethics Principles closely, but the page names no external framework, so no :referencesFramework assertion is made and competency question 7 keeps its zero-row result. The unattributed correspondence is recorded here rather than asserted as a citation."@en ;
